# Kitnap, gift a card promised: the Aura still taps the enchanted creature and gives control of it, but no stun counters go on it, and its gift trigger makes Bot2 draw a card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Kitnap
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
